{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/extras/4b88c9f54ee86cd21587c557582622a0.avif?t=1769048390\" width=1280 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique single-player deck-building adventure game, you will delve into the underground world of a mysterious desert, build your own deck, fight lurking monsters, and unearth lost treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/extras/4acb67b7c2e186772c6c87581ff74332.poster.avif?t=1769048390\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/extras/4acb67b7c2e186772c6c87581ff74332.webm?t=1769048390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/extras/4acb67b7c2e186772c6c87581ff74332.mp4?t=1769048390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build powerful card combinations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/extras/5e690afae1eb28a100ad2a9ec85aa797.avif?t=1769048390\" width=780 height=284 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Encountering unknown creatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/extras/3c86a1dd5c629d6eb84d046acde38583.avif?t=1769048390\" width=634 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dangerous caves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/extras/f71ba21cc119ff8f0c6b7043d7a7b319.avif?t=1769048390\" width=634 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The prosperity of the settlement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/extras/9e1550488db8aa92e7da08bc04c95ed1.poster.avif?t=1769048390\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/extras/9e1550488db8aa92e7da08bc04c95ed1.webm?t=1769048390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/extras/9e1550488db8aa92e7da08bc04c95ed1.mp4?t=1769048390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fork in the road is a fateful choice, and every drip of water could be the countdown to a trap. Bring your torch and courage. The most precious thing in the darkness is never gold, but the unwritten stories\u2014and your legend begins at the next corner.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950260?t=1769048390","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950260?t=1769048390","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/271f53cb8e1e9317413bee2d6d49bf5752429b01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769048390","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/271f53cb8e1e9317413bee2d6d49bf5752429b01/capsule_184x69.j